# Test: OH radical PUMP2 geometry optimization / 6-31G(d,p)
# Open-shell doublet, starting from a slightly stretched geometry.
#
# Optimizer: Cartesian BFGS (diatomic).
# Gradient:  numerical PUMP2 (central FD, h=1e-3 Bohr).
#
# Expected outcome: r(OH) -> ~0.974 A (PUMP2/6-31G(d,p) equilibrium).
#
%method  MP2
%basis   6-31G(d,p)
%job     optimize
%charge  0
%mult    2
%spin    unrestricted
%pump2   yes
%frozen_core 1
%geom_maxiter 30

*geometry angstrom
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.000000   0.969000
*end
